{'symbol': 'HSY', 'date': '2022-07-28 07:05:00', 'title': 'HERSHEY DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'HERSHEY, PA. , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE HERSHEY COMPANY (NYSE: HSY) TODAY ANNOUNCED QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS OF $1.036 ON THE COMMON STOCK AND $0.942 ON THE CLASS B COMMON STOCK, AN INCREASE OF APPROXIMATELY 15%, OR $0.135 AND $0.123 PER SHARE, RESPECTIVELY.'}